# public/Projects holds ~670 MB of raw engineering artefacts — TIA Portal
# runtime data, HMI dumps and screen-recording MP4s (one is 171 MB). None of
# it is committed to git, so it has never been part of a deployment; listing
# it here keeps CLI deploys the same size as the Git ones instead of timing
# out on the upload.
public/Projects

